OverTheWire Bandit: Level 2 → 3

Objective
Obtain the password for Level 3.
The password is stored in a file named spaces in this filename.

Steps
Log in as bandit2:
ssh bandit2@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
List files in the directory:
ls
Read the file containing spaces using quotes:
cat "spaces in this filename"

Result
The file output displays the password for Bandit Level 3.
